ch Flavor, Sea Salt, <meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Natural Flavor from Non-GMO Plants, Purple Carrot, Organic Monk Fruit Flavor, Organic Amla Fruit, </span>Organic Maqui Berries, Organic Manuka Honey, Organic Ginseng, Organic Maca. <b>Contains: Coconut.</b><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><br><br>Note</span>: Sedimentation is normal with natural products. </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tabs__item\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2227/4617/files/Berri_Fit_Nutrition_Facts_480x480.png?v=1708980037\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>",
